 "result_text": "`quiz.get_all_quiz_submissions()` now returns a `PaginatedList`, so it fetches every page instead of stopping at the first 10. I haven't run the tests or tried it against a Canvas instance.\n\nThe change is in `canvasapi/quiz.py`. The method now builds the `PaginatedList` and passes `_root='quiz_submissions'`, because Canvas wraps that endpoint's results in a `quiz_submissions` key. `PaginatedList` already supports that option, and it requests 100 items per page by default. I also updated the `:rtype:` in the docstring.\n\nThe return type changes from a plain list to a `PaginatedList`. Iterating and indexing still work, but `len()` does not.",
